<template><div><h1 id="laravel-helper-functions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#laravel-helper-functions"><span>Laravel Helper Functions</span></a></h1>
<p>A collection of custom helper functions for handling responses, quiz sessions, and participant management in Laravel applications.</p>
<h2 id="overview" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#overview"><span>Overview</span></a></h2>
<p>This helper file provides:</p>
<ul>
<li>🔄 <strong>Response Helpers</strong>: Standardized success/error responses with flash messages</li>
<li>👤 <strong>Session Management</strong>: Quiz participant session binding and verification</li>
<li>🎯 <strong>Participant Tracking</strong>: Guest email and contact information management</li>
</ul>
